- route: Target loss and any non-cut reconcile emit `tether:releaseRated` with no `deliberate` flag. If the swing still grades good or better, the release instrument plays `sfx_massline_release` on top of the snap.
- owner: src/systems/tetherGameplay.js target-loss/484 and _reconcileActive/1395; src/audio/audioSystem.js:_onMasslineInstrument/6382. Dirty file: src/audio/audioSystem.js (strain-cooldown edits sit in this function; the release play is not those lines).
